[0.053, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n  All issues highlighted in the initial review have been resolved and verified:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  1. \u001b[1mExplicit Project Working Directory & Sandbox Confinement\u001b[m\n\u001b[55D\u2022 Resolved via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbedb6f4eb05973d9;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart#L3-L25\u0007Projects\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka026c29ee60bdeb3;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L202-L214\u0007ChatRepository.resolveDefaultWorkingDirectory()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and explicit \u001b[94mworkspaces:\u001b[m\n\u001b[98D\u001b[94m[workingDirectory]\u001b[m + \u001b[94mworkspaceOnly([workingDirectory])\u001b[m in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk58d897d10ba014f7;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L298-L353\u0007ChatRepository.createAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 so release \u001b[94m.app\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cbuilds never silently fall back to \u001b[94m/\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mSession Refresh When Thread Title or Workspace Metadata Changes\u001b[m\n\u001b[62D\u2022 Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk18d4d06bc1da116;file:///Users/brett/t"]
[0.0, "o", "mp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L261-L296\u0007ChatRepository.getOrCreateSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to track \u001b[94m_sessionMetadata\u001b[m (\u001b[94mthreadTitle\u001b[m, \u001b[94mprojectId\u001b[m, and\n\u001b[98D\u001b[94mworkingDirectory\u001b[m) per \u001b[94mthreadId\u001b[m. If any of those change (for example, when a thread is auto-titled or renamed\r\n\u001b[6Cvia \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4931870f2f928d0e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L254-L273\u0007ChatViewModel.renameThread\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), the stale \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb604e3d450ab866a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L11-L15\u0007AntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 is stopped and replaced with a session\r\n\u001b[6Ccarrying the updated system instructions and workspace configuration.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mPer-Thread Composer Draft Isolation\u001b[m\n\u001b[34D\u2022 Added per-thread draft tracking (\u001b[94m_threadDrafts\u001b[m, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk96c0f742278493e7;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dar"]
[0.001, "o", "t#L82-L99\u0007ChatViewModel.draftForThread\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and\n\u001b[83D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk40531f6c3398163f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L92-L99\u0007ChatViewModel.updateActiveThreadDraft\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk89fb0d89a6c9a67f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007ChatViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\n\u001b[56D\u2022 Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd0d6473d6f7eec36;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/markdown_composer.dart#L6-L70\u0007MarkdownComposer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaafb4fb702389c17;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L180-L186\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 so switching \u001b[94mactiveThreadId\u001b[m restores that thread's unsent draft\r\n\u001b[6Cinstead of leaking composer text across threads.\r\n\n\n  \u001b[1m### Verification\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u2022 \u001b[94mdart analyze\u001b[m passes with 0 issues.\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[94mflutter test\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc447f1c4932e2e29;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui"]
[0.0, "o", "_demo/test/widget_test.dart#L666-L746\u0007widget_test.dart:666-746\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) passes all 8 widget test suites, including the new test for per-thread\r\n  draft isolation and session recreation on thread rename.\r\n\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> git commit and tag as step-03-projects-sandbox\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[33m\u25cb\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRunning\u001b[m \u001b[37m(git status && git log -n 5 --oneline --decorate && git tag -l)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u28fd  \u001b[90mGenerating.\u001b[94m..\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m\u2514 Tip: When reviewing a file edit, press f to see the full diff.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
